Where the licence texts are
---------------------------

A package installs all of them at /usr/share/doc/rook/; inside an AppImage the
same files are at usr/share/doc/rook/. The sources are in packaging/assets/, so
the texts are in the repository as well as in the binary.

  LICENSE               Rook's own MIT licence
  sdk-LICENSE           the ego-browser SDK's MIT licence, verbatim upstream
  cef-LICENSE.txt       CEF's BSD-3-Clause licence, verbatim upstream
  cef-CREDITS.html.gz   the engine's complete copyright and third-party list,
                        5.3 MB of HTML gzipped to 600 KB
  node-LICENSE          Node.js's MIT licence plus every project bundled into it
  NOTICE                this file
  copyright             the Debian copyright file for the package


